<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK Q1 REAL GDP GROWTH 5.1 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK Q1 REAL GDP GROWTH 5.1 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Real gross domestic product in the first quarter of the year in Slovakia grew by 5.1 percent year-on-year,compared to 7.3 percent growth for the same period in 1996, the statistical bureau (SUSR) said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
